{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutine-context","title":"协程上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-context","wordCount":623,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程上下文\">协程上下文</h1><p>协程上下文（CoroutineContext）是协程运行时环境的核心配置，决定了协程在哪个线程上执行、如何命名、以及异常如何处理。理解上下文机制是掌握协程调度与管理的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协程上下文的核心是<strong>一个不可变的 Element 集合</strong>：每个 Element 由唯一的 Key 标识，通过 <code>+</code> 组合、按 Key 查找。调度器（决定在哪个线程执行）、Job（决定生命周期）、CoroutineName、异常处理器都作为 Element 参与其中，子协程默认从父作用域继承上下文并可按需覆盖。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"coroutinecontext-结构\">CoroutineContext 结构</h2><p><code>CoroutineContext</code> 是一个不可变的集合，由多个 <code>Element</code> 组合而成，每个 Element 通过唯一的 <code>Key</code> 标识：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val context: CoroutineContext = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(&quot;数据加载&quot;) + SupervisorJob()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val context: CoroutineContext = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(\"数据加载\") + SupervisorJob()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[CoroutineContext] --&gt; B[Job]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Dispatcher]&#10;    A --&gt; D[CoroutineName]&#10;    A --&gt; E[CoroutineExceptionHandler]\">flowchart LR\n    A[CoroutineContext] --&gt; B[Job]\n    A --&gt; C[Dispatcher]\n    A --&gt; D[CoroutineName]\n    A --&gt; E[CoroutineExceptionHandler]</pre><p>上下文元素可以通过 <code>+</code> 运算符组合，右侧元素会覆盖左侧的同 Key 元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val base = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(&quot;基础&quot;)&#10;val overridden = base + Dispatchers.Default // Dispatcher 被覆盖为 Default\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val base = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(\"基础\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val overridden = base + Dispatchers.Default // Dispatcher 被覆盖为 Default</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调度器-dispatchers\">调度器（Dispatchers）</h2><p>调度器决定协程在哪个线程或线程池上执行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调度器</th>\n<th>线程池</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Main</code></td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>UI 更新、轻量操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.IO</code></td>\n<td>共享 IO 线程池（默认 64 线程）</td>\n<td>网络请求、文件读写、数据库操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Default</code></td>\n<td>CPU 核心数大小的线程池</td>\n<td>计算密集型任务（排序、解析、加密）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Unconfined</code></td>\n<td>不限制线程</td>\n<td>测试、特殊场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.*&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    launch(Dispatchers.Default) {&#10;        println(&quot;Default: ${Thread.currentThread().name}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    launch(Dispatchers.IO) {&#10;        println(&quot;IO: ${Thread.currentThread().name}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    launch(Dispatchers.Unconfined) {&#10;        println(&quot;Unconfined 挂起前: ${Thread.currentThread().name}&quot;)&#10;        delay(100)&#10;        println(&quot;Unconfined 恢复后: ${Thread.currentThread().name}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch(Dispatchers.Default) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"Default: ${Thread.currentThread().name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch(Dispatchers.IO) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"IO: ${Thread.currentThread().name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch(Dispatchers.Unconfined) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"Unconfined 挂起前: ${Thread.currentThread().name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"Unconfined 恢复后: ${Thread.currentThread().name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>Dispatchers.Unconfined</code> 会在挂起点后切换到恢复它的线程，通常只用于测试或特殊框架集成。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"线程切换-withcontext\">线程切换：withContext</h2><p>使用 <code>withContext</code> 可以在协程内部切换调度器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun fetchAndParse(): ParsedData {&#10;    val raw = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {&#10;        httpClient.get(&quot;https://api.example.com/data&quot;) // IO 线程&#10;    }&#10;    return withContext(Dispatchers.Default) {&#10;        parseJson(raw) // CPU 密集线程&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun fetchAndParse(): ParsedData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val raw = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        httpClient.get(\"https://api.example.com/data\") // IO 线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return withContext(Dispatchers.Default) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        parseJson(raw) // CPU 密集线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Main as 主线程&#10;    participant IO as IO 线程池&#10;    participant CPU as Default 线程池&#10;&#10;    Main-&gt;&gt;IO: withContext(IO) 网络请求&#10;    IO--&gt;&gt;Main: 返回原始数据&#10;    Main-&gt;&gt;CPU: withContext(Default) 解析&#10;    CPU--&gt;&gt;Main: 返回解析结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Main as 主线程\n    participant IO as IO 线程池\n    participant CPU as Default 线程池\n\n    Main-&gt;&gt;IO: withContext(IO) 网络请求\n    IO--&gt;&gt;Main: 返回原始数据\n    Main-&gt;&gt;CPU: withContext(Default) 解析\n    CPU--&gt;&gt;Main: 返回解析结果</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"上下文继承\">上下文继承</h2><p>子协程自动继承父协程的上下文，但会使用新的 <code>Job</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val parentContext = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(&quot;父协程&quot;)&#10;&#10;val scope = CoroutineScope(parentContext)&#10;scope.launch { // 继承 Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(&quot;父协程&quot;)&#10;    println(&quot;子协程: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    launch(CoroutineName(&quot;内部子协程&quot;)) { // 覆盖 Name，继承 Dispatcher&#10;        println(&quot;内部: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]}&quot;)&#10;        println(&quot;调度器: ${coroutineContext[ContinuationInterceptor]}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val parentContext = Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(\"父协程\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val scope = CoroutineScope(parentContext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scope.launch { // 继承 Dispatchers.IO + CoroutineName(\"父协程\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"子协程: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch(CoroutineName(\"内部子协程\")) { // 覆盖 Name，继承 Dispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"内部: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"调度器: ${coroutineContext[ContinuationInterceptor]}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>继承公式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"子协程上下文 = 父协程上下文 + 子协程参数覆盖 + 新 Job\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>子协程上下文 = 父协程上下文 + 子协程参数覆盖 + 新 Job</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[父 CoroutineContext] --&gt;|继承| B[子协程上下文]&#10;    C[子协程显式参数] --&gt;|覆盖| B&#10;    D[新 Job] --&gt;|替换| B&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;最终上下文 = 父上下文 + 显式覆盖 + 新Job&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[父 CoroutineContext] --&gt;|继承| B[子协程上下文]\n    C[子协程显式参数] --&gt;|覆盖| B\n    D[新 Job] --&gt;|替换| B\n    B --&gt; E[\"最终上下文 = 父上下文 + 显式覆盖 + 新Job\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"coroutinename\">CoroutineName</h2><p><code>CoroutineName</code> 为协程命名，便于调试和日志追踪：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val scope = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Default + CoroutineName(&quot;数据处理&quot;))&#10;&#10;scope.launch {&#10;    println(&quot;运行在: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]?.name}&quot;)&#10;    // 输出: 运行在: 数据处理&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val scope = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Default + CoroutineName(\"数据处理\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"运行在: ${coroutineContext[CoroutineName]?.name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 输出: 运行在: 数据处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配合 <code>-Dkotlinx.coroutines.debug</code> JVM 参数，线程名中会包含协程名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Thread: DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 @数据处理#1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Thread: DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 @数据处理#1</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义上下文元素\">自定义上下文元素</h2><p>可以创建自定义的上下文元素来传递协程级别的数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class RequestId(val id: String) : AbstractCoroutineContextElement(RequestId) {&#10;    companion object Key : CoroutineContext.Key&lt;RequestId&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;suspend fun logWithRequestId(message: String) {&#10;    val requestId = coroutineContext[RequestId]?.id ?: &quot;unknown&quot;&#10;    println(&quot;[$requestId] $message&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;val scope = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Default + RequestId(&quot;req-001&quot;))&#10;scope.launch {&#10;    logWithRequestId(&quot;开始处理&quot;) // [req-001] 开始处理&#10;&#10;    launch(RequestId(&quot;req-002&quot;)) {&#10;        logWithRequestId(&quot;子任务&quot;) // [req-002] 子任务&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class RequestId(val id: String) : AbstractCoroutineContextElement(RequestId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object Key : CoroutineContext.Key&#x3C;RequestId></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun logWithRequestId(message: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val requestId = coroutineContext[RequestId]?.id ?: \"unknown\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"[$requestId] $message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val scope = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Default + RequestId(\"req-001\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logWithRequestId(\"开始处理\") // [req-001] 开始处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch(RequestId(\"req-002\")) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        logWithRequestId(\"子任务\") // [req-002] 子任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义调度器\">自定义调度器</h2><p>通过 <code>Executor</code> 可以创建自定义调度器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import java.util.concurrent.Executors&#10;&#10;val singleThread = Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor()&#10;    .asCoroutineDispatcher()&#10;&#10;val fixedPool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(4)&#10;    .asCoroutineDispatcher()&#10;&#10;val scope = CoroutineScope(fixedPool)&#10;scope.launch {&#10;    println(&quot;运行在自定义线程池: ${Thread.currentThread().name}&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 不再需要时关闭&#10;singleThread.close()&#10;fixedPool.close()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import java.util.concurrent.Executors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val singleThread = Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .asCoroutineDispatcher()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val fixedPool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .asCoroutineDispatcher()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val scope = CoroutineScope(fixedPool)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"运行在自定义线程池: ${Thread.currentThread().name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不再需要时关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>singleThread.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fixedPool.close()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>也可以使用 <code>limitedParallelism</code> 限制并行度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val limitedIO = Dispatchers.IO.limitedParallelism(4)&#10;&#10;repeat(100) {&#10;    scope.launch(limitedIO) {&#10;        // 最多 4 个协程同时在 IO 线程上执行&#10;        performDatabaseQuery()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val limitedIO = Dispatchers.IO.limitedParallelism(4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>repeat(100) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope.launch(limitedIO) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 最多 4 个协程同时在 IO 线程上执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        performDatabaseQuery()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CoroutineContext</strong> 是不可变的元素集合，通过 <code>+</code> 组合，相同 Key 的元素会被覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>Dispatchers</strong> 控制协程的执行线程：Main（主线程）、IO（IO 密集）、Default（CPU 密集）、Unconfined（不限定）</li>\n<li><strong>withContext</strong> 在协程内部切换调度器，不创建新协程</li>\n<li><strong>上下文继承</strong>遵循公式：子上下文 = 父上下文 + 显式覆盖 + 新 Job</li>\n<li><strong>CoroutineName</strong> 用于调试追踪，配合 debug 模式效果更佳</li>\n<li>可以通过 <code>AbstractCoroutineContextElement</code> 创建自定义上下文元素</li>\n<li><code>limitedParallelism</code> 可限制特定调度器的并行度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程上下文","id":"协程上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CoroutineContext 结构","id":"coroutinecontext-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"调度器（Dispatchers）","id":"调度器-dispatchers"},{"level":2,"text":"线程切换：withContext","id":"线程切换-withcontext"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文继承","id":"上下文继承"},{"level":2,"text":"CoroutineName","id":"coroutinename"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义上下文元素","id":"自定义上下文元素"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义调度器","id":"自定义调度器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/channels"}}